    "info": {
      "schema": "tgm.deviceinfo/1",
      "source": "waldorf-press",
      "text": {
        "de": {
          "description": "Der Protein ist ein kompakter Wavetable-Synthesizer, der die Klangerzeugung des Waldorf Microwave mit originalem ASIC-Verhalten nachbildet. Er besitzt zwei Oszillatoren, CEM-Filtermodelle, drei Hüllkurven, zwei LFOs und eine Modulationsmatrix mit acht Slots. Dazu kommen vier Layer, Arpeggiator, Step-Sequencer, MPE-Unterstützung und zwei Effektslots. Er wird per USB-C mit Strom versorgt und ist ab 2025 erhältlich.",
          "features": [
            "8 Stimmen, 4 klangliche Layer (Stacked, Round Robin, Random Robin, MIDI-Split)",
            "Alle Original-Wavetables des Microwave 1, 8-Bit-Quantisierung und Aliasing nachgebildet",
            "CEM-Filtermodelle mit einstellbarer De-Kalibrierung",
            "3 Hüllkurven, 2 LFOs mit Tempo-Sync und Sample & Hold, 8-Slot-Modulationsmatrix",
            "Zwei Effektslots (Reverb, Delay, Chorus, Phaser, Flanger, Drive, EQ, Compressor, Tremolo)",
            "Arpeggiator und Step-Sequencer mit bis zu 32 Schritten, Chord- und Scale-Modus",
            "MPE-kompatibel, MIDI CC Learn",
            "Über 150 Werks-Patches, 250 Patch-Speicherplätze, Import/Export per SysEx"
          ]
        },
        "en": {
          "description": "The Protein is a compact wavetable synthesizer that recreates the Waldorf Microwave sound engine with original ASIC behaviour. It has two oscillators, CEM filter models, three envelopes, two LFOs and an 8-slot modulation matrix. It adds four layers, arpeggiator, step sequencer, MPE support and two effect slots. It is powered over USB-C (released 2025 according to the release event date in the Readme).",
          "features": [
            "8-voice polyphony, 4 timbral layers (stacked, round robin, random robin, MIDI split)",
            "All original Microwave 1 wavetables, 8-bit quantization and aliasing recreated",
            "CEM filter models with adjustable de-calibration",
            "3 envelopes, 2 LFOs with tempo sync and sample & hold, 8-slot modulation matrix",
            "Two effect slots (reverb, delay, chorus, phaser, flanger, drive, EQ, compressor, tremolo)",
            "Arpeggiator and step sequencer with up to 32 steps, chord and scale modes",
            "MPE compatible, MIDI CC Learn",
            "150+ factory patches, 250 patch slots, import/export via SysEx"
          ]
        }
      },
